Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,En 1991, en la
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.88,0:00:01.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Universidad de
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.76,0:00:02.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cambridge, unos
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.71,0:00:03.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,informáticos estaban
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.97,0:00:05.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,hartos de ir a por
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.10,0:00:06.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,café… y encontrarse la
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.49,0:00:07.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,cafetera vacía.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.58,0:00:08.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Así que apuntaron una
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:10.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,cámara a la cafetera y
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.04,0:00:11.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,conectaron la imagen a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:12.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,sus ordenadores.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:13.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Esta es la imagen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.36,0:00:14.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,real. Acababan de
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.36,0:00:15.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,crear lo que hoy se
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.49,0:00:16.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,considera la primera
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.66,0:00:17.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,webcam de la historia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.11,0:00:18.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Años después la
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:20.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,conectaron a internet,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.19,0:00:21.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,y gente de todo el
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.20,0:00:22.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,mundo entraba para
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.21,0:00:23.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,ver… una cafetera.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.38,0:00:23.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tienes once
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:25.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,curiosidades más en la
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.10,0:00:25.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,dosis completa de
